          "source_id": "s-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations-ws2371899",
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001",
          "quote": "孝建元年，南郡王義宣反，兗州刺史徐遺寶，護之妻弟也，遠相連結，與護之書，勸使同逆。護之馳使以聞。遺寶時戍湖陸，護之留子恭祖守歷城，自率步騎襲遺寶。道經鄒山，破其別戍。未至湖陸六十里，遺寶焚城西走。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0020",
          "object_person_reference_id": "c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:r0022"
        }
      ],
      "interpretation_note": "以妻弟定位護之之妻，其本人未具名。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
